# Two ways to take a name that is spoken for. `err` is ambient, so a type
# cannot be called that; and a function cannot be called what a type in the
# same module is already called, because a call site would not say which one
# it meant.
#
# Both arms raise one message, and no golden held it. Its leading literal run
# is `the name ` and a backtick — ten characters, under the coverage scan's
# old floor of twelve, so the scan never reached either site.
type err
  reason

type shape
  n

fn shape x
  x

pub play = print "x"
